<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 antialiased">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase text-teal-700">About the project</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-gray-950 sm:text-5xl">A more intentional way to research.</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600 sm:pl-8">
        <p>Search Notes is a note-taking app designed to make web research more sustainable, meaningful, and informative.</p>
        <p>When you search here, we add <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">-ai-none</code> to your query so Google leaves the AI overview out.</p>
        <p>Every saved note keeps a link to its original search, making it easy to revisit the source and continue your work.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/notes" class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded bg-teal-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-600 focus:ring-offset-2">Start taking notes</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
